  "translation": "Na Ahav i tokim Navot, olsem: Givim ⟨את⟩ wainbel bilong yu long mi, bai em i kamap gaden kaikai bilong mi, bilong em i klostu long haus bilong mi; na bai mi givim yu, long ples bilong em, wanpela wainbel gutpela moa long em. Sapos i gutpela long ai bilong yu, bai mi givim yu silva — pris bilong em.",
